# This app is built with Swift Package Manager (`npx react-native spm`), not CocoaPods.
#
# @react-native-community/cli only detects the iOS project if a Podfile exists,
# and React Native's SwiftPM autolinking uses the CLI config, so this file has to stay.
raise "NitroExample is built with Swift Package Manager. Run `npx react-native spm` instead of `pod install`."
